WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.510
Press a sharp knife
gently onto a tomato,

2
00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.450
and it slides straight
through the skin.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.170
Press a blunt knife just as hard,

4
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.330
and the tomato squashes flat instead.

5
00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.710
Same hand, same push, same tomato.

6
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.350
So what is different
about the sharp blade?

7
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.590
In this mission, you'll see how
pressure depends on the force

8
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.900
and on the area it acts on.

9
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.990
You'll calculate pressure,
measure it in pascals,

10
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.690
and find out why the same force
can do such different jobs.

11
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.790
Your mission: find out why
only the sharp knife cuts.
